nd, collect, and grade assessments for the other three approved candidates. I'll try advancing and let the runtime tell me whether the exit condition holds.","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01AiWygTtcdt54qbEwRoHvgv","name":"advance_phase","input":{"reason":"Budget is nearly exhausted (23/25) and only c156 has been assessed; advancing will show whether the runtime accepts the budget stop as the exit condition."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":32593,"output":343,"cacheRead":2765,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.00345845,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425799931},"0f73680bd81f771ac5e2ff374c28b3d2453b53028e2e5dbf5937024bc0201dcc":{"response":{"text":"I have one tool call left and it can't finish the other three assessments, so I'll prepare the next one (Aditya Novak, c049) so the work can continue after the budget is gone.","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01UxeSvViKzofHvP4Gn3arop","name":"create_assessment","input":{"reason":"Budget is at 24/25 and cannot finish all three remaining assessments; preparing c049's nice-to-have assessment so it is ready for the next run.","candidate_id":"c049","unverified_requirement_ids":["n1","n2"]}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":33818,"output":726,"cacheRead":2765,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.00377245,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425804167},"427df30cc72be3ab682e0dad2211f03bd82fe4a7ccd7efd6492b9527546fac3a":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01CcGcgjxy4a8o133tvxGCap","name":"recall_memory","input":{"reason":"Checking saved HR notes for this role before sourcing, as instructed.","role":"retrieval-backend"}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":509,"output":156,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":2861},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.00048652499999999997,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425910969},"099a25f984ea5e305af91eaf3827550d519230cf71ea64362c7b502b8cec8f1d":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01DeCDA3sjFwaivDHjWG2dWt","name":"search_