NSW vector search, Python services, and FastAPI sentence-encoder serving (embeddings pipeline); citing for all requirements.","candidate_id":"c156","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirement_id":"m2","quote":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."},{"requirement_id":"m3","quote":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirement_id":"n1","quote":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirement_id":"n2","quote":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."}]}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":9181,"output":450,"cacheRead":3220,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.0011753000000000002,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793426755669},"98d53cbf5e076eaca85c4049248b172a5df2a4bc977a798d13710e91a5800378":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_019vUPFFjey6255SJ3XFWZYt","name":"get_profile","input":{"candidate_id":"c066","reason":"Next strongest pgvector/FAISS match (0.75) not yet evidenced; need project sentences for must-haves."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":10930,"output":139,"cacheRead":3220,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.0011947000000000001,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793426756865},"64fc44e5be0ad369eb323394e5d42203d2898e28b029ffb840c8280b412eb994":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01Ks7nWLLrCNyjYGuv5wSvkD","name":"cite_evidence","input":{"reason":"c066 profile shows pgvector/HNSW vector search with recall tuning, FastAPI services (Python), and REST contract design plus encoder serving; citing for all requirements.","candidate_id":"c066","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m1","quo