ths as guardrails and refusal handling.\",\"evidence\":\"guardrails and refusal handling\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-002\",\"skill\":\"Tool-calling workflows\",\"assertion\":\"Lists tool-calling workflows as a strength.\",\"evidence\":\"tool-calling workflows\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-003\",\"skill\":\"LangGraph\",\"assertion\":\"Lists LangGraph as a strength.\",\"evidence\":\"LangGraph.\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-004\",\"skill\":\"Retrieval-augmented chat over internal docs\",\"assertion\":\"Built a grounded chat assistant over internal docs.\",\"evidence\":\"Built a grounded chat assistant over internal docs with citation spans checked against sources.\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-005\",\"skill\":\"Citation verification\",\"assertion\":\"Checked citation spans against sources in a grounded chat assistant.\",\"evidence\":\"citation spans checked against sources\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-006\",\"skill\":\"Retrieval over internal docs\",\"assertion\":\"Built retrieval over internal docs for a shipped grounded chat assistant.\",\"evidence\":\"retrieval over internal docs\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-007\",\"skill\":\"Human-in-the-loop approval for tool calls\",\"assertion\":\"Shipped tool calls gated behind human approval.\",\"evidence\":\"tool calls behind human approval\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-008\",\"skill\":\"Rubric-based model output grading\",\"assertion\":\"Graded model outputs with rubrics and a held-out set.\",\"evidence\":\"Graded model outputs with rubrics and a held-out set\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-009\",\"skill\":\"Release gating with held-out evaluation\",\"assertion\":\"Used a graded held-out set that gates every release.\",\"evidence\":\"a graded held-out set that gates every release\",\"verified\":false},{\"id\":\"skill-010\",\"skill\":\"Regression tracking\",\"assertion\":\"Tracked regressions per release.\",\"evidence\":\"tracked regressions per release\",\"ver