on, recall tuning)","embeddings pipeline (sentence-encoder serving)","API design (REST contract ownership)"]}},{"id":"toolu_01BYuBRzUPVQy46kodwi9c4y","name":"advance_phase","input":{"reason":"The fairness audit ran on the live shortlist with no 3+ place moves, top-5 overlap at 100%, and blind ranking not recommended, so the AUDIT exit condition holds."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":43014,"output":860,"cacheRead":2519,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.00475659,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793429622140},"d24572985aa5c75c399fcc2a0300c1a19ce83807327d4f2996bdcf3fcb7eae43":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01Qzrx8HWb6duyp6HdxuUGv5","name":"advance_phase","input":{"reason":"The fairness audit has run on the live five-candidate shortlist (rho 0.9, top-5 overlap 100%, no moves of 3+ places) and the memory note is saved, so the AUDIT exit condition holds."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":45014,"output":143,"cacheRead":2519,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.00459809,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793429623268},"f239868a09c69b080e0603de7b680b28d1fcacb9e5a0f04c4626509b10b437db":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01JPvPTtPqDTEKMPWuSmQyRL","name":"finalize_shortlist","input":{"reason":"The live audit showed no identity-driven movement, all five candidates have verified must-haves and graded assessments, and the weighted scores give a clear order.","ranked_ids":["c049","c156","c066","c002","c122"],"weights":{"semantic":0.6,"assessment":0.4},"summary":"Shortlist for Senior Backend Engineer, Retrieval Platform, ranked by 0.6 × semantic + 0.4 × assessment:\n1. c049 (0.868): sem 0.78, grade 1.00. Verified on all three must-haves (FAISS, FastAPI/Pydantic, pgvector/HNSW). API design was not verified: the citation was rejected as a skills list.\n2. c156 (0.85): sem 0.75, grade 1.00. All must-haves and embeddings are evidenced. Code tests passed 5/5.\n3. c066 (0.85): sem 0.75, grade 1.00.