 proxy issue.","role":"frontend-design-systems","note":"Session 4: five approved and fully evidenced (c047, c108, c154, c006, c079). All five have React only as a partial proxy via Next.js/Preact UI sentences; explicit React project work is still absent from the pool. c154's first React citation (LCP/CLS sentence) was rejected and the Next.js/Preact sentence was accepted on retry. Assessments: React was the only unverified requirement, so each candidate got one React-targeted question. Only c006 returned a code answer (run_code 3/3 tests). The other four had no code answer, so their grades (c047 0.82, c108 0.95, c154 1.00, c079 0.80) rest on rubric alone. Fairness audit: rho 0.7, top-5 overlap 100%, no moves of 3+ places, no blind ranking needed. Dropped during sourcing: c056 and c155 (keyword-only). Next time, ask every candidate for a code answer so run_code can test all of them, and keep React as the must-have to watch.","preferred_skills":["React (explicit project work, still scarce)","TypeScript (strict typing, zero any)","WCAG audits / screen-reader testing / focus management","Storybook / shared UI kit with theme tokens","Web performance (LCP/CLS, code-splitting)","Next.js / Preact UIs (partial React proxy)"]}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":60975,"output":706,"cacheRead":2519,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.006475689999999999,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793429885931},"3252dcf59e4f931bf2303f27603177ff75827d7be7fe668770204ae3ea373ed0":{"response":{"text":"The fairness audit has run and the memory note is saved, so the AUDIT exit condition is met. Advancing to FINALIZE.","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_015EBYaTfaQRAPFnMddiwhz8","name":"advance_phase","input":{"reason":"fairness_audit ran on the live five-candidate shortlist (rho 0.7, top-5 overlap 100%, no 3+ place moves, no blind ranking needed) and the role memory note is saved, so AUDIT is complete."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":63679,"output":206,"cacheRead":2